                    376.0,
                    701.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) Within five (5) working days after the hearing, each party may submit a brief written summary of the issues raised at the hearing and arguments supporting its position. The umpire shall give his or her settlement within five (5) working days after receiving the briefs. He or she shall provide the parties a brief written statement of the reasons supporting his or her settlement.",
